ect 2>, the enchanted forest with tall moss-covered ancient trees, dappled sunlight filtering through the green canopy, and a winding dirt path lined with wildflowers and red mushrooms. <Subject 1>, the young girl with brown shoulder-length hair, a small braid on her right side, freckles, a yellow sundress, and white sandals, walks along the path from the background toward the foreground, her small woven basket hanging from her left arm. The camera trucks left with small amplitude at slow speed, following her movement as sunlight patches drift across the forest floor around her, leaves gently falling in the breeze.\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a medium close-up of <Subject 1>, the girl in the yellow sundress from Shot 1, as she stops walking and crouches down beside a cluster of red mushrooms with white spots growing at the base of a mossy tree. She sets her woven basket on the ground beside her and leans in closer, tilting her head with curiosity, her brown hair falling forward over her shoulder, dappled sunlight moving across her face and the mushrooms. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as she reaches out one finger toward the largest mushroom, then pauses just before touching it, a gentle smile forming on her freckled face.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft wind rustles through the forest canopy while birds chirp distantly among the trees. The girl's sandals crunch softly on the dirt path, followed by the gentle rustle of her dress as she crouches down.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA gentle piano melody at a moderate tempo with soft string accompaniment and a light glockenspiel countermelody, gradually decreasing in volume at the end.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [736.2622680664062, 334.957275390625], "pos": [-808.4832153320312, 5964.85107421875], "id": 250, "proper